WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.010
At Primary, straightening your teeth starts with a plan for your whole smile.

2
00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.390
First, your Primary iD:

3
00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:11.130
a short assessment of your smile, your health, and how you live.

4
00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:14.430
At your first visit, a digital 3D scan of your teeth,

5
00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.220
and 3D imaging when Dr. Gabi needs it.

6
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:22.280
Dr. Tzur Gabi, a prosthodontist, plans the finished smile with you,

7
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.870
from where each tooth sits to what comes after.

8
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:29.090
For the right cases, he may prescribe AirFlex, by OrthoFX.

9
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.830
A patented HyperElastic polymer.

10
00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:33.900
A highly adaptable inner surface,

11
00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:37.510
designed to conform precisely to the tooth’s outer surface.

12
00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:41.620
OrthoFX’s AirFlex is the first FDA-cleared aligner system

13
00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.690
for at least 12 hours of continuous daily wear.

14
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.970
Now they go in after dinner, and come out with my morning coffee.

15
00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:51.180
Check-ins as you go.

16
00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:54.680
Then your retainers, and a scan comparison at your visits,

17
00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:56.740
so small movement is caught early.

18
00:00:57.520 --> 00:00:59.330
See if aligners are right for you.

19
00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:01.000
Start with your Primary iD.
